// In-process joint harness for the packaged-playback QA group (boxes 4.1/4.2).
// It composes the REAL production graph the way cmd/mellifera does — store,
// module registry, real scanner plugin SUBPROCESSES, the enrich queue with the
// real pack closure over stream.Service, and the composed api+web handler —
// then drives it over real HTTP (httptest.Server). No mocks on any joint: the
// only injected things are the knobs the production wiring itself injects
// (HeadChunk/SegmentTime/PackTimeout for a hermetic fixture size) and, in
// TestStreamsJoint, the task-sanctioned long-run gate wrapped AROUND the real
// pack. cmd/mellifera is package main and cannot be imported, so the three
// thin-shell snippets it owns (the original resolver, the Playback closure,
// and the frontier snapshot assembly) are mirrored here in miniature; every
// module boundary those snippets JOIN is the production code under test.
